---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { networkSections } from '../data/network';

const contact = 'info@signingdayadvisors.com';
---

<Base
  title="About Us"
  description="Signing Day Advisors was founded by collegiate swimmers and student-athletes from Yale, Bowdoin, and Emory who went through high-academic recruiting themselves."
  extraDisclaimer="Professionals listed under Our Network are independent third parties. They are not employed by or affiliated with Signing Day Advisors, and families engage them directly."
>

<!-- SPLIT ABOUT PAGE -->
<section class="about-split">

  <!-- STICKY MISSION -->
  <aside class="mission-panel">

    <div class="mission-inner">

      <span class="eyebrow">Our Mission</span>

      <h1>With purpose</h1>

      <p>SDA was founded by recent graduates of academically rigorous universities, most of whom experienced the college recruiting process firsthand.</p>

      <p>We created SDA because we believe high school athletes deserve transparent, personalized guidance as they navigate one of the most important decisions of their lives. Our mission is to give athletes and their families a clear understanding of where they stand, where they can realistically go, and what it takes to get there. We strive to help each athlete identify the college and program that is the right fit for them academically and athletically.</p>

      <p>We are committed to making the recruiting process simpler and less overwhelming, empowering every athlete to approach it with confidence and a strategy built around who they are, what they want, and what matters most to them.</p>

    </div>

  </aside>


  <!-- SCROLLING RIGHT SIDE -->
  <div class="people-panel">

    <!-- FOUNDERS -->
    <section class="people-section" id="team">

      <div class="people-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Team</span>
        <h2>Meet the Founders</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="team-grid">

        <div class="member">

          <div class="member-photo">
            <img src="/team-img/nareg-minassian.jpg" alt="Nareg Minassian">
          </div>

          <h3 class="member-name">Nareg Minassian</h3>

          <span class="member-title">Managing Partner</span>

          <span class="member-school">Yale University</span>

          <p class="member-bio">Nareg graduated with distinction from Yale University with a degree in Chemistry, while competing as a four-year NCAA Division I swimmer. During his own recruiting process, he focused on academically rigorous universities with competitive swimming programs that could also support his interests in chemistry and research. That experience of balancing athletic fit with academic and long-term career goals helped shape his approach to college recruiting. He qualified for Olympic Trials, set multiple New England records, and ranks among Yale's all-time top ten in three events. He was recognized as a CSC Academic All-District and a CSCAA Scholar All-American Honoree, has held positions at AstraZeneca, Mass General Brigham, and the Harvard T.H. Chan School of Public Health, and is currently pursuing a PhD in Chemistry.</p>

        </div>


        <div class="member">

          <div class="member-photo">
            <img src="/team-img/izz.jpg" alt="Isabella Paoletti">
          </div>

          <h3 class="member-name">Isabella Paoletti</h3>

          <span class="member-title">Managing Partner</span>

          <span class="member-school">Yale University</span>

          <p class="member-bio">Isabella graduated with distinction from Yale University in 2026 with a BA in the History of Science and Medicine and an MS in Personalized Medicine and Applied Engineering, earning Honors in all of her master’s coursework. During her recruiting process, she considered programs across several conferences, prioritizing schools with strong swimming, high academic standards, and support for a pre-med curriculum. That experience now informs how she helps student-athletes evaluate fit across both athletic and academic priorities. At Yale, she competed on the women’s varsity swimming team for four years as a distance swimmer and IMer, competing across a wide range of events and earning an Ivy League podium finish. Isabella has also conducted medical research at Yale and the University of Pennsylvania and currently works in medical 3D design and engineering at Northwell Health’s 3D Design & Innovation Lab.</p>

        </div>


        <div class="member">

          <div class="member-photo">
            <img src="/team-img/ethan-ecsedy.jpg" alt="Ethan Ecsedy">
          </div>

          <h3 class="member-name">Ethan Ecsedy</h3>

          <span class="member-title">Managing Partner</span>

          <span class="member-school">Bowdoin College</span>

          <p class="member-bio">Ethan graduated cum laude from Bowdoin College in 2026, where he was a three-year starter on the varsity football team. Recruited to play football at Bowdoin, he built and executed his own recruiting process from scratch, compiling Hudl film, researching coach timelines, and sending targeted outreach to programs that fit his academic and athletic goals. That hands-on experience navigating the recruiting process as a student-athlete is what led him to co-found Signing Day Advisors, helping other families avoid the guesswork he had to figure out on his own. He received a BS in Molecular and Cellular Biology with a minor in Economics, and has worked across roles at Harvard T.H. Chan School of Public Health, Mass General Brigham, Kura Oncology, and Convergent Therapeutics. He plans to continue his studies as he applies to cancer biology PhD programs.</p>

        </div>


        <div class="member">

          <div class="member-photo">
            <img src="/team-img/finn-henry.jpg" alt="Finn Henry">
          </div>

          <h3 class="member-name">Finn Henry</h3>

          <span class="member-school">Yale University</span>

          <p class="member-bio">Finn graduated from Yale University in 2026 with a degree in Political Science and competed on the men&rsquo;s varsity swimming team as a distance swimmer. His recruiting experience exposed him to schools with very different team cultures, coaching styles, and academic environments, giving him a strong perspective on how much the right program fit can vary from one athlete to another. At Yale, he also managed the team&rsquo;s alumni network and received a team award recognizing sportsmanship, loyalty, and commitment to the Yale swimming tradition. Finn has worked in policy and congressional roles and currently works in consulting in Washington, D.C.</p>

        </div>


        <div class="member">

          <div class="member-photo">
            <img src="/team-img/james-rappaport.jpg" alt="James Dun Rappaport">
          </div>

          <h3 class="member-name">James Dun Rappaport</h3>

          <span class="member-school">Emory University</span>

          <p class="member-bio">James graduated cum laude from Emory University in 2026 with a BBA in Finance and a minor in English. At Emory, he was an active peer tutor for both Statistics and English students and a founding member of the Goizueta Book Club. James has interned in biotechnology and impact investing, and is starting his career in M&amp;A Advisory at FTI Consulting in the fall.</p>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- OUR NETWORK -->
    <section class="network-intro" id="network">

      <span class="eyebrow">Our Network</span>

      <h2>Meet the Specialists We Trust</h2>

      <p class="network-lead">
      We believe athletes should receive guidance from people who are experts in their field. 
      That’s why we’ve built a network of professionals across performance, nutrition, academics, 
      and athlete development. We want to give families a trusted place to turn when needs extend beyond college recruiting.
      </p>

      <p class="network-sub">
        Everyone here works independently of SDA. We make the introduction and step
        back; you decide who is right for your athlete.
      </p>

      <ul class="net-jump">
        {networkSections.map((s) => (
          <li>
            <a href={`#${s.id}`}>
              {s.label}
              {s.people.length > 0 && (
                <span class="net-jump-count">{s.people.length}</span>
              )}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

    </section>


    <!-- NETWORK CATEGORIES -->
    {networkSections.map((s, i) => (

      <section
        class={i % 2 === 1 ? 'net-section net-section-alt' : 'net-section'}
        id={s.id}
      >

        <header class="net-head">

          <span class="eyebrow">{s.eyebrow}</span>

          <h2>{s.label}</h2>

          <p class="net-blurb">{s.blurb}</p>

        </header>


        {s.people.length > 0 ? (

          <div class="team-grid network-grid">

            {s.people.map((p) => (

              <div class="member">

                <div class="member-photo">
                  <img src={p.photo} alt={p.name} />
                </div>

                <h3 class="member-name">{p.name}</h3>

                {p.title && (
                  <span class="member-title">{p.title}</span>
                )}

                {p.org && (
                  <span class="member-school">{p.org}</span>
                )}

                {p.bio && (
                  <p class="member-bio">{p.bio}</p>
                )}

              </div>

            ))}

          </div>

        ) : (

          <div class="net-empty">

            <p class="net-empty-label">Coming soon</p>

            <p class="net-empty-copy">
              We are still vetting {s.label.toLowerCase()} for this list.
              We would rather name nobody than name someone we would not send
              our own athletes to.
            </p>

            <a
              class="net-empty-link"
              href={`mailto:${contact}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(
                'Our Network — ' + s.label
              )}`}
            >
              Recommend a {s.singular}
              <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            </a>

          </div>

        )}

      </section>

    ))}


    <!-- CLOSING -->
    <section class="closing" id="contact">

      <div class="closing-inner">

        <span class="eyebrow">Work with us</span>

        <h2>Talk to an advisor who's been through it.</h2>

        <p>
          A free, fifteen-minute consultation to talk through where your athlete
          stands and whether we're the right fit.
        </p>

        <a class="btn-gold" href="../contact/">
          Book a free consultation
        </a>

      </div>

    </section>


  </div>

</section>

</Base>


<style is:global>

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */

  nav{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:50;
    background:rgba(15,42,74,0.96);
    backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,161,59,0.25);
  }


  /* ---------- SPLIT PAGE ---------- */

  .about-split{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:minmax(300px,32%) minmax(0,68%);
    align-items:start;
    background:#fff;
  }


  /* ---------- MISSION PANEL ---------- */

  .mission-panel{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    height:100vh;
    background:var(--navy);
    color:#fff;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    overflow:hidden;
  }

  .mission-inner{
    width:100%;
    max-width:600px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:70px 54px;
  }

  .mission-panel .eyebrow{
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }

  .mission-panel h1{
    font-size:clamp(42px,4.6vw,64px);
    line-height:1.05;
    color:#fff;
    margin:0 0 30px;
  }

  .mission-panel p{
    font-size:15.5px;
    line-height:1.72;
    color:#C7D2DE;
    margin:0 0 17px;
  }

  .mission-panel p:last-child{
    margin-bottom:0;
  }


  /* ---------- SCROLLING RIGHT SIDE ---------- */

  .people-panel{
    min-width:0;
    background:#fff;
  }


  /* ---------- TEAM ---------- */

  .people-section{
    padding:74px 44px 86px;
  }

  .people-heading{
    margin-bottom:44px;
  }

  .people-heading .eyebrow{
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }

  .people-heading h2{
    font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);
    line-height:1.08;
    color:var(--navy);
    margin:0;
  }


  /* ---------- TEAM GRID ---------- */

  .team-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));
    gap:44px 24px;
  }

  .member{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    min-width:0;
  }

  .member-photo{
    width:100%;
    aspect-ratio:4/5;
    border-radius:6px;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--cream-2);
    margin-bottom:18px;
    position:relative;
    box-shadow:0 24px 40px -28px rgba(15,42,74,0.35);
  }

  .member-photo img{
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    display:block;
    transition:transform .4s ease;
  }

  .member:hover .member-photo img{
    transform:scale(1.035);
  }

  .member-name{
    font-size:19px;
    line-height:1.2;
    color:var(--navy);
    margin:0 0 5px;
  }

  .member-title{
    font-size:13px;
    line-height:1.4;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-bottom:5px;
  }

  .member-school{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:9.5px;
    line-height:1.45;
    letter-spacing:1px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold);
    margin-bottom:12px;
  }

  .member-bio{
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--muted);
    line-height:1.62;
    margin:0;
  }


  /* ---------- NETWORK INTRO ---------- */

  .network-intro{
    padding:82px 44px 72px;
    background:var(--cream-2);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    scroll-margin-top:88px;
  }

  .network-intro .eyebrow{
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:12px;
  }

  .network-intro h2{
    font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);
    line-height:1.08;
    color:var(--navy);
    margin:0 0 24px;
    max-width:700px;
  }

  .network-lead{
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:680px;
    margin:0 0 14px;
  }

  .network-sub{
    font-size:14.5px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:680px;
    margin:0;
  }


  /* ---------- NETWORK JUMP LINKS ---------- */

  .net-jump{
    list-style:none;
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
    margin:32px 0 0;
    padding:0;
  }

  .net-jump a{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:1.5px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--navy);
    border:1px solid rgba(201,161,59,0.55);
    border-radius:2px;
    padding:9px 14px;
    transition:color .2s,border-color .2s,background .2s;
  }

  .net-jump a:hover{
    color:var(--navy);
    background:var(--gold-soft);
    border-color:var(--gold-soft);
  }

  .net-jump-count{
    color:var(--gold);
  }


  /* ---------- NETWORK SECTIONS ---------- */

  .net-section{
    padding:72px 44px 80px;
    background:#fff;
    scroll-margin-top:88px;
  }

  .net-section-alt{
    background:var(--cream-2);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .net-head{
    max-width:720px;
    margin:0 0 44px;
  }

  .net-head .eyebrow{
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }

  .net-head h2{
    font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,44px);
    line-height:1.08;
    color:var(--navy);
    margin:0;
  }

  .net-blurb{
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin:14px 0 0;
  }


  /* ---------- NETWORK EMPTY STATE ---------- */

  .net-empty{
    border:1px dashed var(--line);
    border-radius:6px;
    padding:44px 38px;
    max-width:620px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  }

  .net-empty-label{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:2.5px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold);
    margin:0 0 12px;
    font-weight:500;
  }

  .net-empty-copy{
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin:0 0 20px;
  }

  .net-empty-link{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--navy);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--gold);
    padding-bottom:2px;
    transition:color .2s;
  }

  .net-empty-link span{
    color:var(--gold);
  }

  .net-empty-link:hover{
    color:var(--gold);
  }


  /* ---------- CLOSING ---------- */

  .closing{
    background:var(--navy);
    color:#fff;
    padding:76px 44px;
    text-align:center;
  }

  .closing-inner{
    max-width:680px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }

  .closing .eyebrow{
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }

  .closing h2{
    font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px);
    line-height:1.1;
    color:#fff;
    max-width:640px;
    margin:0 auto 22px;
  }

  .closing p{
    font-size:16px;
    color:#C7D2DE;
    max-width:500px;
    margin:0 auto 32px;
  }

  .btn-gold{
    background:var(--gold);
    color:var(--navy);
    display:inline-block;
    padding:15px 30px;
    border-radius:2px;
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:600;
    transition:all .2s;
  }

  .btn-gold:hover{
    background:var(--gold-soft);
    transform:translateY(-1px);
  }


  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */

  footer{
    background:var(--navy-deep);
    color:#8FA0B3;
    padding:64px 0 40px;
  }


  /* ---------- LARGE / MEDIUM SCREENS ---------- */

  @media(max-width:1250px){

    .about-split{
      grid-template-columns:minmax(300px,34%) minmax(0,66%);
    }

    .people-section{
      padding:68px 36px 80px;
    }

    .team-grid{
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
      gap:42px 26px;
    }

    .mission-inner{
      padding:60px 44px;
    }

    .network-intro,
    .net-section{
      padding-left:36px;
      padding-right:36px;
    }

  }


  /* ---------- TABLET ---------- */

  @media(max-width:900px){

    .about-split{
      display:block;
    }

    .mission-panel{
      position:relative;
      top:auto;
      height:auto;
      min-height:0;
    }

    .mission-inner{
      max-width:760px;
      padding:70px 34px;
    }

    .people-section{
      padding:64px 34px 76px;
    }

    .team-grid{
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
      gap:40px 24px;
    }

    .network-intro{
      padding:68px 34px 62px;
    }

    .net-section{
      padding:64px 34px 72px;
    }

    .closing{
      padding:68px 34px;
    }

  }


  /* ---------- MOBILE ---------- */

  @media(max-width:600px){

    .mission-inner{
      padding:58px 24px;
    }

    .mission-panel h1{
      font-size:42px;
    }

    .mission-panel p{
      font-size:15px;
    }

    .people-section{
      padding:56px 24px 68px;
    }

    .people-heading{
      margin-bottom:34px;
    }

    .team-grid{
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
      gap:46px;
    }

    .member-photo{
      max-width:420px;
    }

    .network-intro{
      padding:60px 24px 54px;
    }

    .net-section{
      padding:56px 24px 64px;
    }

    .net-jump{
      gap:8px;
    }

    .net-jump a{
      font-size:10px;
      padding:8px 11px;
    }

    .net-empty{
      padding:34px 26px;
    }

    .closing{
      padding:60px 24px;
    }

  }

</style>